Package: itb
Type: Package
Title: R Binding for the ITB Triple Pipeline
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("ITB", "Maintainers", email = "a@encloud.asia",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Thin proxy over the libitb shared library's Triple
    Pipeline surface (cmd/cshared). Exposes Single Message and
    Streaming encrypt/decrypt, state-blob export/open, rekey,
    incremental stream sessions, profile registration, and the Go
    runtime knobs. Every hash-name / MAC-name / cipher-name /
    profile-name is an opaque string passed through to Go for
    validation; no ITB construction logic lives in the binding.
License: MIT
URL: https://github.com/everanium/itb
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
NeedsCompilation: yes
